        "char_start": 1148,
        "episode_id": "ep-febd9a8f53bf3a3a",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "I want to dig into that. What's the structural angle most listeners don't have access to?",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 54000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 48000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p04_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:92117a55d30b74ab",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 1470,
        "char_start": 1251,
        "episode_id": "ep-febd9a8f53bf3a3a",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "Yeah, so \u2014 Adobe Lightroom underwater is half about white balance and half about removing magenta. We've seen this play out at teams using Profoto. If you ignore that, you end up rebuilding it from scratch a year later.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 60000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 54000,
